{"id": "order-reph-karma", "category": "order", "rule": "normalize.logical-order", "input": "कर्म", "expected": "कर्म", "source": "issue #4", "notes": "कर्म is क + र् + म. The reph is written before म in logical order and drawn above/after it."}
{"id": "order-rakar-krama", "category": "order", "rule": "normalize.logical-order", "input": "क्रम", "expected": "क्रम", "source": "issue #4", "notes": "क्रम is क् + र + म. The rakar is written after the dead क. Contrast with कर्म."}
