{"id": "reph-rakar-srimati", "category": "reph", "rule": "normalize.rakar", "input": "श्रीमती", "expected": "श्रीमती", "source": "docs/devanagari.md", "notes": "श्री is श + ् + र + ी: rakar, not reph."}
{"id": "reph-segment-artha", "category": "reph", "rule": "segment.reph", "input": "अर्थ", "expected": "अ|र्थ", "source": "docs/devanagari.md", "notes": "A reph belongs to the following aksara: अ is one aksara, र्थ is the next."}
{"id": "reph-segment-karma", "category": "reph", "rule": "segment.reph", "input": "कर्म", "expected": "क|र्म", "source": "docs/devanagari.md", "notes": "The reph in कर्म travels with म, not with क."}
{"id": "reph-segment-karya", "category": "reph", "rule": "segment.reph", "input": "कार्य", "expected": "का|र्य", "source": "docs/devanagari.md", "notes": "का is an aksara; र्य is the next."}
{"id": "matra-o-atomic", "category": "matra", "rule": "normalize.atomic-matra", "input": "हो", "expected": "हो", "source": "docs/devanagari.md", "notes": "U+094B (ो) is atomic; it is not a sequence of े + ा."}
