{"id": "nukta-extra-p-swapnil", "category": "nukta", "rule": "invalid.extra-nukta", "input": "स्वप़्निल", "expected": "स्वप्निल", "source": "issue #4", "notes": "The nukta after प is an OCR artifact. The intended name is स्वप्निल; validate must reject the input."}
{"id": "nukta-extra-badhne", "category": "nukta", "rule": "invalid.extra-nukta", "input": "बढ़्ने", "expected": "बढ्ने", "source": "datasets/translations/Notice_2082-05-04-ocr.txt:125", "notes": "Nukta before the virama is not part of बढ्ने; it is an OCR insertion."}
